  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You come from the line of Peregrin avekiri that left Enara to devote themselves to studying and understanding the realm of dreams, and the reservoir of knowledge and revelations that lay in sleep. You have a sharp, hooked beak with sharp eyes and a more angular face, with plumages that range from deep browns to white. You have a keen sense that lets you navigate back to your home plane or your body while within liminal spaces, dreams and astral planes, granting you a +2 circumstance bonus to checks to do so (such as Seek or Track checks). You also gain the Dreamsense action.</span></p>"
